[[Rentrer chez soi->Chp0_Sb1_Ccl_202]]   [[Speak:SELF]]



:: Chp0_Sb1_Ccl_174 [KEY] {"position":"275,3375","size":"100,100"}
Une dernière série, mon Bill ?  [[>>->Chp0_Sb1_Ccl_175]]  [[Character:BILL-HAPPY]] [[Speak:SELF]]



:: Chp0_Sb1_Ccl_175 {"position":"275,3500","size":"100,100"}
