:: Chp0_Sb1_Ccl_198 {"position":"525,3875","size":"100,100"}
Toi qui es un homme rempli d’ambition. Ce discours te parle. [[>>->Chp0_Sb1_Ccl_199]]  [[Character:SELF-]] 



:: Chp0_Sb1_Ccl_199 {"position":"525,4000","size":"100,100"}
